{id:'segment',num:'03',name:'少标注边界分割',en:'Boundary-aware segmentation with limited labels',tag:'最稳健 / Feasible',tagtype:'green',risk:'低中 / Low–med',resource:'低中 / Low–med',ratings:[4,5,4,4],question:'标签不足时，显式边界建模能否改善 U-Net 的边界预测，而不仅是整体 Dice？',questionEn:'Can explicit boundary modeling improve U-Net contours under limited labels, beyond whole-mask Dice?',hypothesis:'边界辅助损失或边界分支有望提升轮廓 F1，且对少标注训练更有帮助；也可能牺牲区域 IoU。',hypothesisEn:'A boundary loss or branch may improve contour F1, especially under label scarcity, but could reduce region IoU.',dataset:'Oxford-IIIT Pet：约 7,349 张图像、37 个宠物类别，提供像素级 trimap。需保留官方测试集并从训练集创建验证集。',datasetEn:'Oxford-IIIT Pet has ~7,349 images across 37 breeds with pixel-level trimaps; reserve official test data and carve out validation.',datasetUrl:'https://www.robots.ox.ac.uk/~vgg/data/pets/',baseline:'团队实现轻量 U-Net，使用 Cross Entropy / Dice 作标准分割损失。',baselineEn:'Team-implemented compact U-Net with cross-entropy or Dice-based baseline loss.',innovation:'实现可组合的 boundary-aware loss 和辅助边界预测 head；研究标签量对收益的影响。',innovationEn:'Implement modular boundary-aware loss and auxiliary contour head; study label-budget sensitivity.',experiments:['E0：标准 U-Net / standard U-Net','E1：边界损失 only / boundary loss only','E2：辅助边界头 only / contour head only','E3：5% / 20% / 100% 标注量，重复随机子集'],metrics:'mIoU、Dice、Boundary F1、分组误差（毛发/遮挡/复杂背景）、GPU-hours',riskNote:'宠物数据集领域较窄；必须把“标签稀缺 + 边界质量”的因果问题做深，而非仅展示彩色分割图。',fallback:'若边界头不稳定，只研究 boundary loss × label fraction × contour error，仍能形成完整消融。',citation:'Oxford-IIIT Pet',type:'vision'},
