function openTopic(id){let t=topics.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!t)return;const sec=(title,content,cls='')=>`<div class="detail-section ${cls}"><h4>${title}</h4>${content}</div>`;document.getElementById('modal-body').innerHTML=`<div class="eyebrow">RESEARCH BLUEPRINT ${t.num}</div><h2 id="modal-title">${t.name}</h2><div class="modal-en">${t.en}</div><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:17px"><span class="pill ${t.tagtype}">${t.tag}</span><span class="pill gray">Risk · ${t.risk}</span><span class="pill gray">Compute · ${t.resource}</span></div><div class="detail-grid">${sec('研究问题 · RESEARCH QUESTION',`<p>${t.question}<span class="en">${t.questionEn}</span></p>`,'full')}${sec('可证伪假设 · HYPOTHESIS',`<p>${t.hypothesis}<span class="en">${t.hypothesisEn}</span></p>`,'full')}${sec('数据集 · DATASET',`<p>${t.dataset}<span class="en">${t.datasetEn}</span></p><p><a target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="${t.datasetUrl}">查看数据来源 / Dataset source ↗</a></p>`)}${sec('基线系统 · BASELINE',`<p>${t.baseline}<span class="en">${t.baselineEn}</span></p>`)}${sec('团队技术贡献 · IMPLEMENTATION',`<p>${t.innovation}<span class="en">${t.innovationEn}</span></p>`,'full')}${sec('实验矩阵 · CONTROLLED EXPERIMENTS',`<ul>${t.experiments.map(s=>`<li>${s}</li>`).join('')}</ul>`)}${sec('核心指标 · METRICS',`<p>${t.metrics}</p>`)}${sec('主要风险 · FAILURE RISKS',`<p>${t.riskNote}</p>`)}${sec('应急降级 · FALLBACK',`<p>${t.fallback}</p>`)}</div><div class="detail-note">研究严谨性 / Research hygiene：固定数据划分、记录 seed 与 Git commit、控制训练预算、保留测试集、分析失败案例。实验数与重复次数必须在初期吞吐 benchmark 后再锁定。<span class="en">Freeze splits and budgets, log seeds and commits, protect the held-out test set, and size the experiment plan after a compute smoke test.</span></div>`;let modal=document.getElementById('topic-modal');modal.classList.add('show');document.body.style.overflow='hidden';document.querySelector('.modal-window').scrollTop=0;document.querySelector('.modal-close').focus()}
